qtclient (CipSoft-compatible Qt/QML client)
==========================================

Not affiliated with CipSoft GmbH. This project is an independent
implementation of a CipSoft-compatible client and launcher. It is **not** an
official Tibia product. "Tibia" and related marks are trademarks of CipSoft
GmbH; use of those names here is descriptive only.

qtclient is a Qt/QML port of the CipSoft client architecture: vendored CIP QML
and contracts via `make tibia-sync` / `make sync`, handwritten controllers under
`client/tibia/`, and a CIP tip-protocol launcher. Behavior is checked against
CipSoft — not against other open clients.

