Qt
--
Builds link against Qt 6 (typically LGPL). Redistributors of binaries must
comply with the Qt license applicable to their build (LGPL or commercial).
Qt is not shipped in this repository; install with `make qt`.

xBRZ (optional product pack)
----------------------------
When a product pack under `client/mods/` links Zenju xBRZ (GPLv3) — e.g. for HD
sprite scaling — that pack is subject to GPLv3. Stock CIP-core builds only
expose the `sprites/hdscale` hook and do not link xBRZ.

CipSoft material (BYO license)
------------------------------
The sync tree (`client/upstream/`, `launcher/upstream/`) and extracted assets
(`data/assets/`, sounds, `graphics_resources.rcc`) are CipSoft-derived. They
are **not** redistributed by a public cut of this project. Obtain them from a
licensed Tibia install via `make tibia-sync` / `make sync` and `make extract`.
